### =====================================================================
### Lab08 – A05 Injection: Cross-Site Scripting (CWE-79)
### Upute: docs/labs/lab08-xss.md
### Napomena: XSS se "vidi" tek u PREGLEDNIKU – URL-ove iz koraka 2) i 5) otvorite u Chromeu/Firefoxu.
### =====================================================================
@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1) Legitimna pretraga
GET {{host}}/lab08/search?q=Laptop

### 2) NAPAD (reflektirani XSS): otvorite u pregledniku:
###    http://localhost:5080/lab08/search?q=<script>alert(document.cookie)</script>
GET {{host}}/lab08/search?q=%3Cscript%3Ealert(document.cookie)%3C%2Fscript%3E

### 3) NAPAD (reflektirani XSS bez <script>): http://localhost:5080/lab08/search?q=<img src=x onerror=alert('XSS')>
GET {{host}}/lab08/search?q=%3Cimg%20src%3Dx%20onerror%3Dalert(%27XSS%27)%3E

### 4) NAPAD (pohranjeni XSS): recenzija s HTML-om
POST {{host}}/api/lab08/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1, "author": "Napadač", "text": "<img src=x onerror=alert('XSS')>"}

### 5) Stranica s recenzijama – otvorite u pregledniku: http://localhost:5080/lab08/products/1/reviews
GET {{host}}/lab08/products/1/reviews

### 6) Legitimna recenzija
POST {{host}}/api/lab08/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1, "author": "Ivana", "text": "Odličan proizvod, preporučujem."}

### 7) PROVJERA POPRAVKA: odgovor sadrži &lt;script&gt; umjesto <script>, a zaglavlje
###    Content-Security-Policy sadrži script-src
GET {{host}}/lab08/search?q=%3Cscript%3Ealert(1)%3C%2Fscript%3E
